{"boundary":"The result concerns the mod-two coefficient module End(H1 mod 2). It does not compute integral or 2-adic H^2 with non-field coefficients.","cartan_eilenberg_stable_elements":{"constraint_rank":35,"double_coset_table":[{"constraint_rank":0,"intersection_order":64,"representative":""},{"constraint_rank":14,"intersection_order":2,"local_H2_dimension":81,"representative":"a"},{"constraint_rank":14,"intersection_order":2,"local_H2_dimension":81,"representative":"A"},{"constraint_rank":29,"intersection_order":8,"local_H2_dimension":38,"representative":"b"},{"constraint_rank":29,"intersection_order":8,"local_H2_dimension":38,"representative":"B"},{"constraint_rank":0,"intersection_order":1,"representative":"ab"},{"constraint_rank":0,"intersection_order":1,"representative":"aB"},{"constraint_rank":0,"intersection_order":1,"representative":"AB"},{"constraint_rank":12,"intersection_order":2,"local_H2_dimension":81,"representative":"aba"},{"constraint_rank":29,"intersection_order":8,"local_H2_dimension":38,"representative":"aBa"},{"constraint_rank":29,"intersection_order":8,"local_H2_dimension":38,"representative":"AbA"},{"constraint_rank":4,"intersection_order":4,"local_H2_dimension":15,"representative":"ABB"},{"constraint_rank":29,"intersection_order":8,"local_H2_dimension":38,"representative":"bAb"},{"constraint_rank":29,"intersection_order":8,"local_H2_dimension":38,"representative":"BaB"},{"constraint_rank":4,"intersection_order":4,"local_H2_dimension":15,"representative":"abAb"},{"constraint_rank":24,"intersection_order":16,"local_H2_dimension":100,"representative":"aBaB"},{"constraint_rank":4,"intersection_order":4,"local_H2_dimension":15,"representative":"AbAb"},{"constraint_rank":24,"intersection_order":16,"local_H2_dimension":100,"representative":"bbAb"},{"constraint_rank":17,"intersection_order":32,"local_H2_dimension":30,"representative":"abbbA"},{"constraint_rank":17,"intersection_order":32,"local_H2_dimension":30,"representative":"aBBBA"},{"constraint_rank":24,"intersection_order":16,"local_H2_dimension":100,"representative":"abaBAb"},{"constraint_rank":24,"intersection_order":64,"local_H2_dimension":36,"representative":"abaBBB"},{"constraint_rank":24,"intersection_order":64,"local_H2_dimension":36,"representative":"bbbABA"},{"constraint_rank":9,"intersection_order":32,"local_H2_dimension":30,"representative":"aBABAbb"}],"double_cosets":24,"intersection_distribution":{"1":3,"16":3,"2":3,"32":3,"4":3,"64":3,"8":6},"stable_dimension":1},"certificate_sha256":"4ff46e6e35bcf8e9a317774a156f0ea9d8588bebfd95922cb2165e3ce49d79e0","checks":{"certificate_hash_locked":true,"double_cosets24":true,"global_traceless_H2_zero":true,"group_order25920":true,"intersection_orders_locked":true,"scalar_class_supplies_the_stable_line":true,"stable_H2_dimension1":true,"stable_constraint_rank35":true,"sylow_H2_End_dimension36":true,"sylow_order64":true},"global_degree_two":{"H2_End_dimension":1,"conclusion":"H^2(PSp(4,3),End(V)) is exactly the scalar Schur-multiplier line; H^2(PSp(4,3),sl(V))=0.","scalar_dimension":1,"traceless_dimension":0},"schema":"w33.pass801.global_h2_stable_elements.v1","status":"PASS","sylow_resolution":{"H2_End_dimension":36,"free_ranks":[3,4,6,9],"sylow_order":64},"theorem":"The full mod-two degree-two obstruction space of the 81-dimensional W33 homology module is exactly one-dimensional and scalar. A minimal projective resolution over a Sylow-2 subgroup P of order 64 gives dim H^2(P,End(V))=36. Cartan-Eilenberg stable-elements constraints were then imposed for all 24 double cosets P\\G/P using explicit comparison maps through every intersection order 1,2,4,8,16,32,64. The combined constraint rank is 35, leaving one stable class. Because the known scalar Schur-multiplier class already supplies one nonzero global class, the stable line is exactly scalar and H^2(PSp(4,3),sl(V))=0. Together with Pass 681 H^1=0, the representation is formally rigid and has no traceless ambient degree-two obstruction classes."}
